            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERedis connector for Umbraco 15/16/17 (.NET 9/10). Auto-composes StackExchange.Redis distributed cache, persists ASP.NET Core Data Protection keys to Redis (default key: AF.Umbraco.Redis.Connector:_DataProtectionKeys), performs startup fail-fast connectivity validation, and includes optional smoke endpoints.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/af.umbraco.redis.connector\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
